    "Description": "Red Hat JBoss Enterprise Application Platform 7 is a platform for Java applications based on the WildFly application runtime.\n\nThis asynchronous patch is a security update for Red Hat JBoss Enterprise Application Platform 7.4.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* commons-beanutils (CVE-2025-48734)\n\nA Red Hat Security Bulletin which addresses further details about this flaw is available in the References section.\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgements, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
